<title>USA: Loctite committee to review Henkel proposal.</title>
<headline>Loctite committee to review Henkel proposal.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loctite Corp said it established a special committee of outside directors not affiliated with Henkel to review the acquisition proposal received from Henkel KGaA.</p>
<p>Earlier this week, Henkel offered to buy the 65 percent of Loctite it did not already own for about $56 per share.</p>
<p>Loctite said the special committee retained Dillon, Read &amp; Co Inc as its financial advisor and Fried, Frank, Harris, Shriver &amp; Jacobson as its counsel.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
